{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07667","headline":"东皇太一词 · 李希仲","name":"东皇太一词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吉日初齐戒，灵巫穆上皇。\n焚香布瑶席，鸣佩奠椒浆。\n缓舞花飞满，清歌水去长。\n回波送神曲，云雨满潇湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李希仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}